msgctxt "124"
msgid "You're not half bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "I never would've guessed an old geezer like you could beat me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "You look pretty young. How'd you get into this business?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Age doesn't matter in my line of work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"The boss trained me himself. Some kind of special program for the "
"\"gifted,\" if you will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Did he, now? He the head of the Reapers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "The gun I'm using was a coming-of-age present from him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Who is this guy, exactly?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "You know I can't tell you that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "If the boss found out I'd ratted on him, I'd be dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "...I just wish I could've lived up to his expectations, that's all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"(Sounds like he knows some important information about the guy who's "
"running the Reapers...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"(I bet Ibuki could probably get it outta him without resorting to "
"violence...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "Dammit! We'll remember this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Don't expect me to thank you. I didn't ask for your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "I'm out of here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Are you the Reaper Yuto?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Now I see how it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"You thought I might kill them 'cause you knew who I was. That's why you "
"intervened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "Well, don't worry. I don't kill people unless I'm getting paid for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Unfortunately for you, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "I can get paid for shutting up people who figure out who I am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Nothing personal, but I'm going to have to kill you."
msgstr ""

